{"seq":2,"slug":"simplify-conditionals","title":"简化条件逻辑与循环结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/code-refactoring-legacy/refactoring-techniques/simplify-conditionals","wordCount":2083,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"简化条件逻辑与循环结构\">简化条件逻辑与循环结构</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>条件简化不是&quot;把 if 写短&quot;，而是把&quot;分支爆炸&quot;还原成&quot;概念层次&quot;。四个关键概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>圈复杂度来自路径数</strong>：每多一个独立分支就多一条执行路径，验证成本随路径数增长。简化的目标是压路径，不是压字符。</li>\n<li><strong>条件名 vs 条件式</strong>：把 <code>if (a &amp;&amp; b || c)</code> 变成 <code>if (isEligible(x))</code>，改动的是&quot;读者要理解几个概念&quot;，而不是判断本身。</li>\n<li><strong>分支即策略选择</strong>：当分支是在&quot;按类型挑选算法&quot;时，它本质上是多态的雏形；当分支是在&quot;按数据取值挑选常量&quot;时，它更适合被表/特例吸收。</li>\n<li><strong>控制流与数据的分离</strong>：循环里混合了&quot;遍历&quot;和&quot;计算&quot;两件事时，先拆开，再决定哪一半值得命名。</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>症状</th>\n<th>根因</th>\n<th>手法族</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单条条件表达式本身太复杂</td>\n<td>多个子条件未命名</td>\n<td>Decompose / Consolidate</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>嵌套层数太深</td>\n<td>缺提前返回</td>\n<td>Guard Clauses</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分支按类型发散</td>\n<td>该用多态</td>\n<td>Replace Conditional with Polymorphism</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有&quot;空/默认&quot;分支</td>\n<td>缺特例对象</td>\n<td>Introduce Special Case</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>循环承担多种操作</td>\n<td>遍历与计算耦合</td>\n<td>Replace Loop with Pipeline</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>前三者降低&quot;读懂一条路径&quot;的成本，后两者降低&quot;分支/循环总数&quot;本身。实际重构中通常先用 Guard Clauses 削平嵌套，再处理剩下的类型发散。</p>\n<h2 id=\"条件逻辑为何容易失控\">条件逻辑为何容易失控</h2><p>条件逻辑是程序复杂度的主要来源。函数的圈复杂度（Cyclomatic Complexity）直接由独立执行路径的数量决定，而每一个 if/else、switch/case、三元表达式都会增加路径数。当条件逻辑嵌套过深或分支过多时，代码的可读性急剧下降——人脑追踪多层条件的能力非常有限。</p>\n<p>更危险的是，复杂的条件逻辑往往会随时间进一步恶化。新的业务规则通常以&quot;在现有条件中添加新分支&quot;的方式实现，导致条件表达式持续膨胀。如果不主动简化，条件逻辑很快会成为系统中最难理解、最容易引入 Bug 的区域。</p>\n<p>本节介绍的重构手法针对条件和循环结构，将复杂的控制流转化为清晰的、可独立理解的代码单元。</p>\n<h2 id=\"decompose-conditional-分解条件表达式\">Decompose Conditional（分解条件表达式）</h2><h3 id=\"动机\">动机</h3><p>当一个 if-else 结构的条件判断和各分支的执行体都比较复杂时，整个结构变得难以理解。Decompose Conditional 将条件判断和各分支分别提取为命名良好的函数，让读者在更高的抽象层级理解逻辑流程。</p>\n<h3 id=\"操作模式\">操作模式</h3><p>将复杂的条件结构：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"if (condition)&#10;  then-branch&#10;else&#10;  else-branch\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>if (condition)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  then-branch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>else</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  else-branch</span></span></code></pre></div><p>转变为：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"if (isSummerSeason(date))&#10;  charge = summerRate(quantity)&#10;else&#10;  charge = regularRate(quantity)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>if (isSummerSeason(date))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  charge = summerRate(quantity)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>else</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  charge = regularRate(quantity)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键价值在于：条件函数名解释了&quot;在什么情况下&quot;，分支函数名解释了&quot;做什么&quot;。原来需要逐行阅读才能理解的逻辑，现在一行就能把握全局。</p>\n<h3 id=\"进一步简化\">进一步简化</h3><p>如果分解后的结构足够简单，可以用三元表达式进一步简化：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const charge = isSummerSeason(date) ? summerRate(quantity) : regularRate(quantity);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> charge</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> isSummerSeason</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(date) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> summerRate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(quantity) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> regularRate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(quantity);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>但注意：三元表达式仅适用于条件与分支都足够简短的情况。如果三元表达式本身需要换行才能阅读，则保持 if-else 结构更清晰。</p>\n<h2 id=\"consolidate-conditional-expression-合并条件表达式\">Consolidate Conditional Expression（合并条件表达式）</h2><h3 id=\"动机\">动机</h3><p>当多个条件判断导致相同的结果时，应将它们合并为一个条件表达式。合并后的表达式可以进一步提取为命名函数，让代码表达&quot;为什么返回这个结果&quot;而非&quot;在哪些具体情况下返回&quot;。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// 合并前：看不出这些条件的共同意图&#10;if (employee.seniority &lt; 2) return 0;&#10;if (employee.monthsDisabled &gt; 12) return 0;&#10;if (employee.isPartTime) return 0;&#10;&#10;// 合并后：意图清晰&#10;if (isNotEligibleForDisability(employee)) return 0;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 合并前：看不出这些条件的共同意图</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (employee.seniority </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (employee.monthsDisabled </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (employee.isPartTime) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 合并后：意图清晰</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">isNotEligibleForDisability</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(employee)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"判断标准\">判断标准</h3><p>合并的前提是：这些条件的存在有一个统一的业务原因。如果多个条件恰好导致相同结果但原因不同（纯属巧合），则不应合并——它们未来可能会分化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"replace-conditional-with-polymorphism-以多态替代条件\">Replace Conditional with Polymorphism（以多态替代条件）</h2><h3 id=\"动机\">动机</h3><p>当系统中存在基于类型的条件分支，且这种分支在多处重复出现时，Replace Conditional with Polymorphism 是最具变革性的重构手法之一。它将散布在各处的 switch/if-else 结构转化为继承层次中的多态方法调用。</p>\n<h3 id=\"适用模式\">适用模式</h3><p><strong>模式一：类型码驱动的行为差异</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// 重构前：switch 语句散布在多个函数中&#10;function calculatePay(employee) {&#10;  switch (employee.type) {&#10;    case &#39;engineer&#39;:&#10;      return employee.monthlySalary;&#10;    case &#39;salesman&#39;:&#10;      return employee.monthlySalary + employee.commission;&#10;    case &#39;manager&#39;:&#10;      return employee.monthlySalary + employee.bonus;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 重构前：switch 语句散布在多个函数中</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> calculatePay</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">employee</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  switch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (employee.type) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'engineer'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> employee.monthlySalary;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'salesman'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> employee.monthlySalary </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> employee.commission;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'manager'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> employee.monthlySalary </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> employee.bonus;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>模式二：变体行为的封装</strong></p>\n<p>当一组对象共享大部分行为但在某些方面有差异时，将差异点实现为多态方法。</p>\n<h3 id=\"实施步骤\">实施步骤</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[识别类型码条件] --&gt; B[创建子类层次]&#10;    B --&gt; C[将 switch 各分支移入对应子类]&#10;    C --&gt; D[在基类定义多态方法]&#10;    D --&gt; E[替换条件为多态调用]&#10;    E --&gt; F[删除原 switch 语句]\">graph TD\n    A[识别类型码条件] --&gt; B[创建子类层次]\n    B --&gt; C[将 switch 各分支移入对应子类]\n    C --&gt; D[在基类定义多态方法]\n    D --&gt; E[替换条件为多态调用]\n    E --&gt; F[删除原 switch 语句]</pre><p>详细步骤：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>如果条件表达式不在独立函数中，先 Extract Function</li>\n<li>创建基类（或使用现有基类），定义多态方法的签名</li>\n<li>为每种类型创建子类</li>\n<li>将每个条件分支的逻辑移入对应子类的重写方法</li>\n<li>将基类方法标记为抽象（或提供默认实现）</li>\n<li>删除原始的条件表达式</li>\n<li>运行测试</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"何时不适用\">何时不适用</h3><p>并非所有 switch 都应该用多态替代：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>如果 switch 只出现一次且不太可能扩展新分支 → 保持 switch 更简洁</li>\n<li>如果分支数量极少（2-3 个）且逻辑简单 → 多态的类层次反而增加复杂度</li>\n<li>如果条件基于数据而非类型（如数值范围判断） → 多态不是正确的工具</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"replace-nested-conditional-with-guard-clauses-以卫语句替代嵌套条件\">Replace Nested Conditional with Guard Clauses（以卫语句替代嵌套条件）</h2><h3 id=\"动机\">动机</h3><p>深度嵌套的 if-else 结构（&quot;箭头型代码&quot;）严重降低可读性。Guard Clauses（卫语句）通过提前返回将异常情况处理从主逻辑中分离，使代码呈现&quot;扁平化&quot;的结构。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// 重构前：嵌套深度使人迷失&#10;function getPayAmount(employee) {&#10;  let result;&#10;  if (employee.isSeparated) {&#10;    result = { amount: 0, reasonCode: &#39;SEP&#39; };&#10;  } else {&#10;    if (employee.isRetired) {&#10;      result = { amount: 0, reasonCode: &#39;RET&#39; };&#10;    } else {&#10;      // 正常计算逻辑（10+ 行）&#10;      result = computeNormalPay(employee);&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;  return result;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 重构后：卫语句清晰分离异常情况&#10;function getPayAmount(employee) {&#10;  if (employee.isSeparated) return { amount: 0, reasonCode: &#39;SEP&#39; };&#10;  if (employee.isRetired) return { amount: 0, reasonCode: &#39;RET&#39; };&#10;  return computeNormalPay(employee);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 重构前：嵌套深度使人迷失</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getPayAmount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">employee</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (employee.isSeparated) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { amount: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, reasonCode: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SEP'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (employee.isRetired) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { amount: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, reasonCode: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'RET'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      // 正常计算逻辑（10+ 行）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> computeNormalPay</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(employee);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><s