pan></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"适用判断\">适用判断</h3><p>卫语句适用于&quot;一条主路径 + 多个异常出口&quot;的模式。如果条件分支之间是&quot;平等的替代方案&quot;（如处理不同的支付方式），则不应使用卫语句——它们暗示了&quot;这些只是特殊情况处理&quot;的语义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"replace-loop-with-pipeline-以管道替代循环\">Replace Loop with Pipeline（以管道替代循环）</h2><h3 id=\"动机\">动机</h3><p>传统的命令式循环（for/while）要求读者在脑中模拟执行过程：维护循环变量、追踪累加器状态、理解 break/continue 的影响。集合管道（Collection Pipeline）使用声明式操作（map、filter、reduce、flatMap）描述数据转换的每一步，让读者关注&quot;做什么&quot;而非&quot;怎么做&quot;。</p>\n<h3 id=\"常见转换模式\">常见转换模式</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>循环模式</th>\n<th>管道等价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>循环 + 条件跳过</td>\n<td><code>.filter(predicate)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>循环 + 结果转换</td>\n<td><code>.map(transform)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>循环 + 累加</td>\n<td><code>.reduce(accumulator)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>循环 + 查找第一个</td>\n<td><code>.find(predicate)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>循环 + 全部满足</td>\n<td><code>.every(predicate)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>循环 + 存在满足</td>\n<td><code>.some(predicate)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>嵌套循环 + 展平</td>\n<td><code>.flatMap(transform)</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"示例\">示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// 重构前：命令式循环&#10;const results = [];&#10;for (const person of people) {&#10;  if (person.age &gt;= 18) {&#10;    const name = person.firstName + &#39; &#39; + person.lastName;&#10;    results.push(name);&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 重构后：声明式管道&#10;const results = people.filter((person) =&gt; person.age &gt;= 18).map((person) =&gt; `${person.firstName} ${person.lastName}`);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 重构前：命令式循环</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> results</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> person</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> people) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (person.age </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> person.firstName </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ' '</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> person.lastName;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    results.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(name);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 重构后：声明式管道</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> results</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> people.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">person</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> person.age </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">person</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">person</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">firstName</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">} ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">person</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">lastName</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"适用边界\">适用边界</h3><p>管道并非总是优于循环：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>当循环中有复杂的状态依赖（当前迭代结果依赖前一次迭代的中间状态）时，强行转为管道可能降低可读性</li>\n<li>性能敏感的热路径中，管道的中间数组创建可能带来额外开销</li>\n<li>需要提前终止且语言不支持惰性求值时，循环的 break 更直接</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"introduce-special-case-引入特例\">Introduce Special Case（引入特例）</h2><h3 id=\"动机\">动机</h3><p>当代码中频繁出现对某个特殊值（通常是 null、&quot;unknown&quot;、空集合）的检查时，Introduce Special Case 将这些检查封装为一个专门的对象。最常见的应用是 Null Object 模式——用一个行为确定的对象替代 null 检查。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// 重构前：null 检查散布各处&#10;const customerName = customer !== null ? customer.name : &#39;occupant&#39;;&#10;const plan = customer !== null ? customer.plan : registry.billingPlans.basic;&#10;&#10;// 重构后：Unknown Customer 特例对象&#10;class UnknownCustomer {&#10;  get name() {&#10;    return &#39;occupant&#39;;&#10;  }&#10;  get plan() {&#10;    return registry.billingPlans.basic;&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;// 调用处无需条件检查&#10;const customerName = customer.name;&#10;const plan = customer.plan;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 重构前：null 检查散布各处</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> customerName</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> customer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> customer.name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'occupant'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> plan</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> customer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> customer.plan </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> registry.billingPlans.basic;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 重构后：Unknown Customer 特例对象</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> UnknownCustomer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  get</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'occupant'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  get</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> plan</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> registry.billingPlans.basic;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 调用处无需条件检查</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> customerName</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> customer.name;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> plan</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> customer.plan;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"实施条件\">实施条件</h3><p>引入 Special Case 的前提是：对该特殊值的处理逻辑在多处重复且一致。如果不同位置对 null 的处理方式不同，则不应使用此手法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"组合应用策略\">组合应用策略</h2><p>简化条件逻辑的重构往往需要多种手法协同配合：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[复杂条件结构] --&gt; B{条件类型?}&#10;    B --&gt;|嵌套深| C[Guard Clauses 扁平化]&#10;    B --&gt;|分支多且基于类型| D[多态替代]&#10;    B --&gt;|复杂表达式| E[Decompose Conditional]&#10;    B --&gt;|重复 null 检查| F[Introduce Special Case]&#10;    C --&gt; G[再评估结果]&#10;    D --&gt; G&#10;    E --&gt; G&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H{仍有复杂循环?}&#10;    H --&gt;|是| I[Replace Loop with Pipeline]&#10;    H --&gt;|否| J[完成]\">graph TD\n    A[复杂条件结构] --&gt; B{条件类型?}\n    B --&gt;|嵌套深| C[Guard Clauses 扁平化]\n    B --&gt;|分支多且基于类型| D[多态替代]\n    B --&gt;|复杂表达式| E[Decompose Conditional]\n    B --&gt;|重复 null 检查| F[Introduce Special Case]\n    C --&gt; G[再评估结果]\n    D --&gt; G\n    E --&gt; G\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H{仍有复杂循环?}\n    H --&gt;|是| I[Replace Loop with Pipeline]\n    H --&gt;|否| J[完成]</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>简化条件和循环是提升代码可读性投入产出比最高的重构类别。Decompose Conditional 为条件结构赋予语义名称，Guard Clauses 消除嵌套深度，多态替代将类型分支分散到各自的类中，管道替代循环让数据转换逻辑一目了然。这些手法的共同目标是降低认知负担——让代码在正确的抽象层级表达意图，使读者无需模拟执行就能理解逻辑流程。在 2026 年的现代语言中，模式匹配（Pattern Matching）、代数数据类型等特性为条件简化提供了更多语言级支撑。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"简化条件逻辑与循环结构","id":"简化条件逻辑与循环结构"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"条件逻辑为何容易失控","id":"条件逻辑为何容易失控"},{"level":2,"text":"Decompose Conditional（分解条件表达式）","id":"decompose-conditional-分解条件表达式"},{"level":3,"text":"动机","id":"动机"},{"level":3,"text":"操作模式","id":"操作模式"},{"level":3,"text":"进一步简化","id":"进一步简化"},{"level":2,"text":"Consolidate Conditional Expression（合并条件表达式）","id":"consolidate-conditional-expression-合并条件表达式"},{"level":3,"text":"动机","id":"动机"},{"level":3,"text":"判断标准","id":"判断标准"},{"level":2,"text":"Replace Conditional with Polymorphism（以多态替代条件）","id":"replace-conditional-with-polymorphism-以多态替代条件"},{"level":3,"text":"动机","id":"动机"},{"level":3,"text":"适用模式","id":"适用模式"},{"level":3,"text":"实施步骤","id":"实施步骤"},{"level":3,"text":"何时不适用","id":"何时不适用"},{"level":2,"text":"Replace Nested Conditional with Guard Clauses（以卫语句替代嵌套条件）","id":"replace-nested-conditional-with-guard-clauses-以卫语句替代嵌套条件"},{"level":3,"text":"动机","id":"动机"},{"level":3,"text":"适用判断","id":"适用判断"},{"level":2,"text":"Replace Loop with Pipeline（以管道替代循环）","id":"replace-loop-with-pipeline-以管道替代循环"},{"level":3,"text":"动机","id":"动机"},{"level":3,"text":"常见转换模式","id":"常见转换模式"},{"level":3,"text":"示例","id":"示例"},{"level":3,"text":"适用边界","id":"适用边界"},{"level":2,"text":"Introduce Special Case（引入特例）","id":"introduce-special-case-引入特例"},{"level":3,"text":"动机","id":"动机"},{"level":3,"text":"实施条件","id":"实施条件"},{"level":2,"text":"组合应用策略","id":"组合应用策略"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"提取与内联：重构的基础操作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/code-refactoring-legacy/refactoring-techniques/extract-and-inline"},"next":{"title":"对象与继承结构重构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/code-refactoring-legacy/refactoring-techniques/object-restructuring"}}